invalid type: string "GLOF Event: Lower Barun 2021\nYear: 2021\nTrigger: moraine erosion and high melting\nFatalities: 0\nDamage USD: 1000000\nDetails: Lower Barun glacial lake experienced a minor outburst flood in 2021 due to progressive moraine piping and high summer melting. The warning allowed downstream hydropower projects to open gates, preventing casualties and limiting infrastructure damag